# November 28, 2026: Nova Scotia, nineteen places in twelve counties outside Annapolis and Lunenburg: Digby (Church Point, Digby),
# Shelburne (Shelburne, Barrington), Yarmouth, Kings (Starr's Point), Cumberland (Tidnish, Wallace River), Pictou, Antigonish,
# Guysborough, Richmond (Arichat, St. Peter's), Inverness (Orangedale, Cheticamp). Region ns drawn by tools/choose.py --thinnest
# (59 places before). Sources opened in this session: the Canadian Register of Historic Places statement for every place
# (historicplaces.ca, read with tools/page.py --all); the Nova Scotia Museum's own pages for the Old Meeting House and the Dory Shop
# (hours); Wikipedia's lists of historic places by county (Register ids, coordinates). Hours for the other museums came from web
# search results that quoted the operators' pages and were not confirmed; they are left as "?" where the sources disagree.
from data_b import N
def L(t,u): return [t,u]
def HP(t,i): return ['Canadian Register of Historic Places: '+t,'https://www.historicplaces.ca/en/rep-reg/place-lieu.aspx?id=%d'%i]
BATCH={'key':'ns_hdtv','label':'Nova Scotia: Digby to Cape Breton','added':'2026-11-28 06:44'}
